          {
            "id": "s1:p1",
            "text": "Plantago holosteum is an annual plant of the family Plantaginaceae and the genus Plantago."
          },
          {
            "id": "s1:p2",
            "text": "Description\nPlantago holosteum grows to {{convert|15|-|40|cm}} in height. The flowering period extends from May to June."
          },
          {
            "id": "s1:p3",
            "text": "Distribution and habitat\nThis species is native to Southern Europe and parts of the Middle East and Northwest Africa. It prefers dry grasslands, arid and sunny grassy areas on carbonate substrates, at an elevation of {{convert|0|-|1300|m}} above sea level."
          }
        ]
      }
